scopecontent.p:
Dr. Marmor's academic and professional work is represented by his manuscript drafts;
            lecture drafts and audio- recordings; and virtually all of his offprinted and reprinted
            publications.

The personal history series features documents related to Dr. Marmor's war-time
            military service; photographs of friends, family and colleagues; publicity portraits;
            and publicity clippings from magazines and newspapers.
